  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a media projection session where the application receiving an instance of this class
            is sharing its own content.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a media projection session where the application receiving an instance of this class is sharing its own content.</para>
      <para>The application must use this class to notify if the sharing session terminates from its side (e.g. the shared content is not available anymore).</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/projection/AppContentProjectionSession" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.media.projection.AppContentProjectionSession</code>.</a></format></para>
